 visible accidental noise. This is current qualitative reassessment, not new verdicts under corrected criteria or family style approval.",host_limit:"Images opened through view_image; no graphical UI renderer, physical display calibration or full/compact rendering acceptance."},integration:{command:"node verify-integration.mjs assets/ready-confirmed.png",exit_code:0,finding:"Both actual source consumers return Ready, assets/ready-confirmed.png, frames1 after ok->succeeded; PNG hash matches exact retained candidate. No graphical renderer or alpha-compositing acceptance."},current_production:{requirements_hash:load("focused").requirements_hash,state_hash:load("focused").production.hash,revision:14,task:load("focused").production.task,task_state:"done",candidate:"ready.retained",pending_jobs:[],immediate_derived_action:"review_delivery",provider:"pixellab-test",provider_simulated:true,remote_id:"controlled-create-0002",validation:"PIXL validate returned valid:true files_verified:true revision14. Runtime new_request_allowed is not permission."},resolved_with_same_specialist:["Removed unsupported dominant-blue rule","Clarified intended backing/partial-alpha versus unwanted matte","Clarified semantic-essential readability","Kept sample meaning independent of nonexistent family assets","Scoped pixel construction as expert proposal permitting intentional techniques","Replaced historical authorization/resume with PHASE and actual completed state; corrected exact citation bounds"],unresolved_findings:[],next:"Specialist save immutable exact PLAR handoff linking this independent comparison; caller then verifies handoff against fresh focused PLAR and saves HANDOFF-RESULT.json."};
